    {
      "source": "Returns if the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/WebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a> should be ignored and not used for\nmatching. If this method returns <code>true</code> then the context will not be used and\nthe <a href=\"../../../web/servlet/ApplicationContextRequestMatcher.html#matches(jakarta.servlet.http.HttpServletRequest)\"><code>matches</code></a> method will return <code>false</code>.",
      "translation": "如果应忽略 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/WebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a> 且不将其用于匹配，则返回该值。如果此方法返回 <code>true</code>`，则不会使用该上下文，且 <a href=\"../../../web/servlet/ApplicationContextRequestMatcher.html#matches(jakarta.servlet.http.HttpServletRequest)\"><code>matches</code></a> 方法将返回 <code>false</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Method that can be implemented by subclasses that wish to initialize items the\nfirst time that the matcher is called. This method will be called only once and\nonly if <a href=\"../../../web/servlet/ApplicationContextRequestMatcher.html#ignoreApplicationContext(org.springframework.web.context.WebApplicationContext)\"><code>ApplicationContextRequestMatcher.ignoreApplicationContext(WebApplicationContext)</code></a> returns\n<code>false</code>. Note that the supplied context will be based on the\n<strong>first</strong> request sent to the matcher.",
      "translation": "子类可以实现的用于在首次调用匹配器时初始化项目的方法。此方法仅会被调用一次，且仅在 <a href=\"../../../web/servlet/ApplicationContextRequestMatcher.html#ignoreApplicationContext(org.springframework.web.context.WebApplicationContext)\"><code>ApplicationContextRequestMatcher.ignoreApplicationContext(WebApplicationContext)</code></a> 返回<code>false</code> 时才会执行。请注意，提供的上下文将基于发送给匹配器的<strong>第一个</strong>请求。",
      "count": 2
    },
